ing  altitude of settle airliners yet despite  all this Ukraine did not close its  airspace  even though Russia was part of the  international team of investigators  Moscow has already rubbished the final  report calling it biased  and the Russian arms manufacturer Alma's  auntie that makes the book missiles  disclosed the findings of its own  reconstructions and possible scenarios  even before the official Dutch report  was published the results of our  experiments have entirely refuted the  conclusions by the Dutch commission  about the type of the rocket and the  place of the knowledge their conclusions  the missile could not have been fired by  Russian or separatist forces but instead  came from an area controlled by  Ukrainian government troops the missile  itself was an old model they say no  longer used by the Russians  when there was the whistlin in my year I  personally have no doubts that it was an  operation which was planned by Russian  special services to bring down Malaysian  Airlines civil plane flight mh17 it was  made from territory which was under the  control of Russian rebels and there's no  doubt that drunk separatists do not know  how to operate book systems it means  those systems were operated by  professional Russian servicemen only  despite the denials there is an ongoing  criminal investigation into the attack  on MH 17 and prosecutors now say they've  identified what they call persons of  interest that they haven't said who they  are or where they are they have they'll  let it be known that their inquiries  which were expected to be concluded by  the end of this year will now drag on  into 2016  for the families of those who perished  on the Malaysia Airlines flight there is  some comfort in knowing finally what  happened to their loved ones and that  they're unlikely to have suffered for  long they are still for now denied a  definitive answer to who murdered them  at 33,000 feet  you
 

